            "review_text": "Ben N\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam14 contributions\n0\nChoo choo train restaurant in Ho Chi Minh!\nMar 2023 • Family\nFantastic restaurant where your food is brought to you on a train.Our son Georgie loved it! Very friendly owner Maxim and his wife. Kim their eldest daughter is a delightful salesperson. Mixture of Western and Vietnamese food all very reasonably priced. Definitely recommend the restaurant and we will return\nWritten March 11, 2023",
